{"work_id": "MX3-023", "matched_key": "必须学会做经济工作", "normalized_offset": 4, "normalized_context": "1014必须学会做经济工作一九四五年一月十日各位劳动英雄各位模范工作者你们开了会总结了经验大家欢迎你们尊敬你们你们有三种长处起了三个作用第一个带头作用这就是因为你们特别努力有许多创造你们的工作成了一般人的模范提高了工作标准引起了大家向你们学习第二个骨干作用你们的大多数现在还不是干部但是你们已经是群众中的骨干群众中的核心有了你们工作就好推动了到了将来你们可能成为干部你们现在是干部的后备军第三个桥梁作用你们是上面的领导人员和下面的广大群众之间的桥梁群众的意见经过你们传上来上面的意见经过", "cue_words": [], "title_form_signal": "near_page_heading", "witness_id": "A-30d13185d1f27d6e4de9", "source_url": "https://ebook.dswxyjy.org.cn/dswxbooks/storage/files/20220801/4c7451f802ad6cc211c9bec38ffc1acd46133/mobile/javascript/search_config.js", "raw_sha256": "db32b9fe81193d6391370affabe7b05b930968e84a81546362eba301a8e72fdd", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "maoxuan-official", "volume": 3, "basis": "official_book_landing_and_reader_configuration"}], "kind": "reader_page", "number": 235, "end": 235, "record_path": "archive/records/A-30d13185d1f27d6e4de9.json", "text_path": "archive/text/A-30d13185d1f27d6e4de9.txt", "source_title": "毛泽东选集（第三卷）〔官方阅读器全文文字层〕", "source_media": "official_page_text", "source_layer": "official_reader_text", "edition_verification_status": "not_independently_verified", "public_url_rechecked_this_run": false, "family": "maoxuan", "id": "C-55148e19f079562d", "status": "candidate_only_not_work_identity_revision_or_causation", "normalization": "NFKC plus letters/digits only; context is NOT a verbatim quote"}
